BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Category: Events\nInstructor: Lisa S.\nPlease join us in celebrating our Yoga Program Manager\, Lisa Skaff\, and her partner\, Stephen\, who are expecting a baby later this fall! You're invited to their baby shower on Sunday\, November 1st!\nThose who know Stephen and Lisa know they're dedicated\, multi-sport athletes. Did you know Lisa is still doing handstands at 8 months pregnant?!\nIn their honor\, expect a few physical challenges (weighted bellies included)\, along with some more relaxed games. Participation in the games is totally optional\, and we just want you there! We’ll also have light refreshments\, so please RSVP so we can prepare accordingly.\nhttps://portal.movementgyms.com/portland/programs/community-pay-what-you-want-night?course=U2Vzc2lvbjoxOTA5NDk5ODg=&date=2026-11-01
DTEND:20261101T230000Z
LOCATION:Movement Portland
DTSTART:20261101T210000Z
SUMMARY:Lisa & Stephen's Baby Shower
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
UID:01a7ceefa8af6daec74ac770d9a6f66d781fe8249babd207a34804972ba9a9ea@movement-portland-events
URL:https://portal.movementgyms.com/portland/programs/community-pay-what-you-want-night?course=U2Vzc2lvbjoxOTA5NDk5ODg=&date=2026-11-01
END:VEVENT
